diff --git a/doc/whatsnew/fragments/7228.bugfix b/doc/whatsnew/fragments/7228.bugfix
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..798c352
--- /dev/null
+++ b/doc/whatsnew/fragments/7228.bugfix
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+Fix a crash when an invalid regular expression is supplied for an option (e.g. a
+`function-rgx` using the unsupported `\p{...}` syntax). Pylint now reports a
+readable error message instead of a traceback.
+
+Closes #7228
